			<nav aria-label="breadcrumbs" class="rank-math-breadcrumb"><p><a href="https://www.mappr.co">Home</a><span class="separator"> &raquo; </span><a href="https://www.mappr.co/capital-cities/">Capital Cities</a><span class="separator"> &raquo; </span><span class="last">What is the Capital of France?</span></p></nav>		</div>
